      "image": "zexal_school",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yuma Tsukumo's story begins on a day like any other at Heartland City's local middle school."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It was there that he came across his friend Bronk dueling Shark, the school bully. Shark was a powerful duelist and a master of Xyz Summons."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "bronkstone",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "ARRRGGHHH!"
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Thanks for the duel. And for your deck!"
    },
    {
      "char": "bronkstone",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Not so fast!"
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "My name is Yuma. And I'm Bronk's good friend."
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Bronk and I had an arrangement. Whoever won got the other's duel deck."
    },
    {
      "char": "bronkstone",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Is that true?"
    },
    {
      "char": "bronkstone",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "It is. But I had to do it! He called me a big chicken."
    },
    {
      "char": "bronkstone",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Fine then! If you’re gonna challenge my friend, then I’m gonna challenge you!"
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "If you beat me, I'll give back this deck. But if I win, Yuma – I get your deck."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "zexal_school",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "And on that Sunday, Yuma kept his word and faced off against Shark."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Hope you said your goodbyes because all your cards are about to be mine!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Sorry, but the only thing that you’re gonna be getting is a good old-fashioned butt-kickin’!"
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "When I win your duel deck, I'm gonna trash it. Then maybe you'll learn your lesson: don't pick fights you can't win!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "That's where you're wrong, Shark. I'll never learn that lesson. I'll keep trying to high five the sky because when you're feeling the flow, there's no going back!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "duel_smile",
      "text": "And speaking of feelin’ the flow... I SO AM."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "zexal_kingskey",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "duel_neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It was then that the Golden Key necklace around Yuma's neck, gifted to him by his missing parents, released something that would change his life forever."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Through the key, Yuma's courage released a being from an unknown realm. A being that only he could see and hear."
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "zexal_kingskey",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "duel_surprise",
      "text": "Who... are you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "RIGHT:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "duel_sad",
      "text": "Can you talk?"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "duel_anger",
      "text": "Say something already!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Astral."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "duel_neutral",
      "text": "Huh? What's an Astral?"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "My name if I recall. But I do not recall much of anything."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "duel_sad",
      "text": "Aww, great. Why do I gotta deal with this walking flashlight right before my most important duel ever?"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Duel? That word is familiar to me..."
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Yes, I recall that I know how to duel. Observe!"
    }
  ]
